# Scenario name
msgid "The Edge-of-Space"
msgstr "The Edge-of-Space"

# Scenario description
msgid ""
"You command the Technician Cruiser Apollo, a repair ship on the border of "
"dangerous space.\n"
"\n"
"The Apollo is outfitted with minimal weapons as there is a cease-fire "
"between the Human Navy and the neighboring Kraylor.\n"
"\n"
"You are tasked with discovering the cause of damage on one of your deep "
"space telescopes.\n"
"\n"
"This scenario is limited to one player ship: the Atlantis Apollo."
msgstr "You command the Technician Cruiser Apollo, a repair ship on the border of dangerous space.\n\nThe Apollo is outfitted with minimal weapons as there is a cease-fire between the Human Navy and the neighboring Kraylor.\n\nYou are tasked with discovering the cause of damage on one of your deep space telescopes.\n\nThis scenario is limited to one player ship: the Atlantis Apollo."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:40
msgctxt "callsign-ship"
msgid "Technical Officer"
msgstr "Technical Officer"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:55
msgctxt "callsign-station"
msgid "E.O.S. scope"
msgstr "E.O.S. scope"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:61
msgctxt "callsign-station"
msgid "Midspace Support"
msgstr "Midspace Support"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:66
msgctxt "callsign-station"
msgid "Central Command"
msgstr "Central Command"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:73
msgctxt "callsign-station"
msgid "K-Endline"
msgstr "K-Endline"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:78
msgctxt "callsign-station"
msgid "K-Midline"
msgstr "K-Midline"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:358
msgctxt "centralcommandGoal-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in.\n"
"\n"
"Our edge-of-space telescope has been malfunctioning for the past few days. "
"We expect the cause to be a mechanical failure, but we want you to take a "
"look.\n"
"\n"
"The E.O.S. scope is on the border of Kraylor space, so maintain contact and "
"keep up long-range scans.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with the E.O.S. scope and investigate the damage. Transmitting your "
"report via standard communications channels is too dangerous given the "
"already delicate nature of our treaty with the Kraylor, so return to Central "
"Command to report your findings.\n"
"\n"
"Reopen communications if you have any questions."
msgstr "Apollo, come in.\n\nOur edge-of-space telescope has been malfunctioning for the past few days. We expect the cause to be a mechanical failure, but we want you to take a look.\n\nThe E.O.S. scope is on the border of Kraylor space, so maintain contact and keep up long-range scans.\n\nDock with the E.O.S. scope and investigate the damage. Transmitting your report via standard communications channels is too dangerous given the already delicate nature of our treaty with the Kraylor, so return to Central Command to report your findings.\n\nReopen communications if you have any questions."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:409
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:564
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:594
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:627
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid "Apollo, you've incited a war! What a disaster..."
msgstr "Apollo, you've incited a war! What a disaster..."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:421
msgctxt "KraylorEndline-incCall"
msgid ""
"A Human Naval cruiser encroaching on Kraylor space?\n"
"\n"
"Be warned: if you venture near our Endline territory, we will have no choice "
"but to view your actions as hostile. Our indestructible fleet will make "
"short work of you."
msgstr "A Human Naval cruiser encroaching on Kraylor space?\n\nBe warned: if you venture near our Endline territory, we will have no choice but to view your actions as hostile. Our indestructible fleet will make short work of you."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:436
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"The Kraylor's Endline station is near our E.O.S. scope.\n"
"\n"
"Do not confront them; we're not trying to start a war."
msgstr "The Kraylor's Endline station is near our E.O.S. scope.\n\nDo not confront them; we're not trying to start a war."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:453
msgctxt "KraylorEndline-incCall"
msgid ""
"Attention Human Naval vessel:\n"
"\n"
"We have noted your expansion toward Kraylor Endline territory. Know that "
"even the slightest act of aggression will be met with a forceful purging of "
"all human ships and stations from our sector of space.\n"
"\n"
"Do what maintenance you must while you are here, but know also that we "
"consider your telescopic station to be a potential threat."
msgstr "Attention Human Naval vessel:\n\nWe have noted your expansion toward Kraylor Endline territory. Know that even the slightest act of aggression will be met with a forceful purging of all human ships and stations from our sector of space.\n\nDo what maintenance you must while you are here, but know also that we consider your telescopic station to be a potential threat."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:474
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Away Team in transit."
msgstr "Away Team in transit."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:479
msgctxt "technicalofficer-incCall"
msgid ""
"We're beginning our inspection of the E.O.S. scope facility.\n"
"\n"
"This shouldn't take long."
msgstr "We're beginning our inspection of the E.O.S. scope facility.\n\nThis shouldn't take long."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:497
msgctxt "technicalofficer-incCall"
msgid ""
"It looks like the databanks are still in good working order.\n"
"\n"
"We'll retrieve what we can."
msgstr "It looks like the databanks are still in good working order.\n\nWe'll retrieve what we can."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:519
msgctxt "technicalofficer-incCall"
msgid ""
"Is something wrong Apollo? We're still in the facility.\n"
"\n"
"Please dock so we can come aboard."
msgstr "Is something wrong Apollo? We're still in the facility.\n\nPlease dock so we can come aboard."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:538
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Away Team have returned."
msgstr "Away Team have returned."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:544
msgctxt "technicalofficer-incCall"
msgid ""
"Our inspection of the scope facility is complete. We retrieved much of the "
"data recorded over the past few days, though proper analysis will require an "
"expert.\n"
"\n"
"We should hurry back to Central Command with this so they can begin work."
msgstr "Our inspection of the scope facility is complete. We retrieved much of the data recorded over the past few days, though proper analysis will require an expert.\n\nWe should hurry back to Central Command with this so they can begin work."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:576
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"It appears the damage was mechanical, but Kraylor ships in the area have "
"been spotted in surveillance data you recovered from the E.O.S. scope. It's "
"possible this was sabotage.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever the case, we need you to rendezvous with science station Galileo in "
"sector %s. We've contracted this Arlenian station to interpret and analyze "
"data retrieved from our various scope stations."
msgstr "It appears the damage was mechanical, but Kraylor ships in the area have been spotted in surveillance data you recovered from the E.O.S. scope. It's possible this was sabotage.\n\nWhatever the case, we need you to rendezvous with science station Galileo in sector %s. We've contracted this Arlenian station to interpret and analyze data retrieved from our various scope stations."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:605
msgctxt "Galileo-incCall"
msgid ""
"Distress signal incoming from Galileo station:\n"
"\n"
"Kraylor ships are in our vicinity, and we believe they intend to attack us! "
"Please, you are the only battle-ready ship near our sector. Assist us!"
msgstr "Distress signal incoming from Galileo station:\n\nKraylor ships are in our vicinity, and we believe they intend to attack us! Please, you are the only battle-ready ship near our sector. Assist us!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:642
msgctxt "Galileo-incCall"
msgid ""
"We don't know why Kraylor ships were attacking us. We had just recieved word "
"that your ship was on its way with data from the edge-of-space telescopic "
"station when they began interrupting transmissions.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for defending our station. Please dock with us, and we'll analyze "
"the data from the E.O.S. scope."
msgstr "We don't know why Kraylor ships were attacking us. We had just recieved word that your ship was on its way with data from the edge-of-space telescopic station when they began interrupting transmissions.\n\nThank you for defending our station. Please dock with us, and we'll analyze the data from the E.O.S. scope."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:660
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in!\n"
"\n"
"Leave the E.O.S. data with Galileo for now, we've confirmed reports that "
"Kraylor are brazen enough to attack our E.O.S. scope directly! All available "
"ships should converge on E.O.S. territory in sector %s!\n"
"\n"
"That means you, Apollo!"
msgstr "Apollo, come in!\n\nLeave the E.O.S. data with Galileo for now, we've confirmed reports that Kraylor are brazen enough to attack our E.O.S. scope directly! All available ships should converge on E.O.S. territory in sector %s!\n\nThat means you, Apollo!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:694
msgctxt "human-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, HM1 here.\n"
"\n"
"Central Command has no choice but to declare war. We're moving into Kraylor "
"territory for our retaliatory strike. Attack the Kraylor Endline station!"
msgstr "Apollo, HM1 here.\n\nCentral Command has no choice but to declare war. We're moving into Kraylor territory for our retaliatory strike. Attack the Kraylor Endline station!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:718
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in.\n"
"\n"
"We have no choice but to declare war. Move into Kraylor territory and "
"retaliate on their defenseless Endline station!"
msgstr "Apollo, come in.\n\nWe have no choice but to declare war. Move into Kraylor territory and retaliate on their defenseless Endline station!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:749
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:835
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in.\n"
"\n"
"Our cease-fire with the Kraylor is at a bitter end, and aggression will only "
"rise from here. It is imperative that our ships be equipped with all counter-"
"measures necessary to keep them safe.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with the E.O.S. scope. We are re-fitting your ship in preparation for "
"wartime."
msgstr "Apollo, come in.\n\nOur cease-fire with the Kraylor is at a bitter end, and aggression will only rise from here. It is imperative that our ships be equipped with all counter-measures necessary to keep them safe.\n\nDock with the E.O.S. scope. We are re-fitting your ship in preparation for wartime."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:776
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:861
msgctxt "KraylorMline-incCall"
msgid ""
"Broadcast on all Human Naval frequencies:\n"
"\n"
"Human scum, we warned you to stay out of Kraylor territory!"
msgstr "Broadcast on all Human Naval frequencies:\n\nHuman scum, we warned you to stay out of Kraylor territory!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:799
#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:884
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in.\n"
"\n"
"Our cease-fire with the Kraylor is at a bitter end. Destroy the remaining "
"Kraylor ships threatening our E.O.S. territory!"
msgstr "Apollo, come in.\n\nOur cease-fire with the Kraylor is at a bitter end. Destroy the remaining Kraylor ships threatening our E.O.S. territory!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:922
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in.\n"
"\n"
"Kraylor aggression will only rise from here. It is imperative that our ships "
"be equipped with all counter-measures necessary to keep them safe.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with the E.O.S. scope. We are re-fitting your ship in preparation for "
"wartime."
msgstr "Apollo, come in.\n\nKraylor aggression will only rise from here. It is imperative that our ships be equipped with all counter-measures necessary to keep them safe.\n\nDock with the E.O.S. scope. We are re-fitting your ship in preparation for wartime."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:967
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Science station Galileo has completed their analysis of the E.O.S. scope "
"data.\n"
"\n"
"Edge-of-space sensors picked up sparse signals from the super-nebula in "
"Kraylor space that indicate they have some kind of wormhole. Intelligence "
"suggests they intend to use it to infiltrate human space and attack us where "
"we are defenseless!\n"
"\n"
"When your ship is finished being outfitted for war, move up to the nebula, "
"but be cautious. There may be traps."
msgstr "Science station Galileo has completed their analysis of the E.O.S. scope data.\n\nEdge-of-space sensors picked up sparse signals from the super-nebula in Kraylor space that indicate they have some kind of wormhole. Intelligence suggests they intend to use it to infiltrate human space and attack us where we are defenseless!\n\nWhen your ship is finished being outfitted for war, move up to the nebula, but be cautious. There may be traps."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:986
msgctxt "centralcommand-incCall"
msgid ""
"Apollo, come in!\n"
"\n"
"Reports are coming in from core human space that a massive Kraylor strike "
"force is attacking! Get through that wormhole and attack from within their "
"ranks to hold them off. We'll send all our available ships to converge there."
msgstr "Apollo, come in!\n\nReports are coming in from core human space that a massive Kraylor strike force is attacking! Get through that wormhole and attack from within their ranks to hold them off. We'll send all our available ships to converge there."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1195
msgctxt "callsign"
msgid "Central Command"
msgstr "Central Command"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1203
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommand-comms"
msgid ""
"The E.O.S. scope is in sector %s, right on the edge of Kraylor territory.\n"
"\n"
"Be careful out there."
msgstr "The E.O.S. scope is in sector %s, right on the edge of Kraylor territory.\n\nBe careful out there."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1215
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid "Return to Central Command with your report on the malfunction."
msgstr "Return to Central Command with your report on the malfunction."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1226
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"The Arlenian science station Galileo is in sector %s. Lay in a course "
