msgstr "The Arlenian science station Galileo is in sector %s. Lay in a course bearing 356 from Central Command and deliver the E.O.S. scope data there."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1239
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"Save Galileo station! They're under attack in sector %s, and we need them to "
