msgstr "Save Galileo station! They're under attack in sector %s, and we need them to analyze that data!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1252
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"Dock with Galileo station in sector %s and deliver the E.O.S. scope data."
msgstr "Dock with Galileo station in sector %s and deliver the E.O.S. scope data."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1264
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"Kraylor ships are directly attacking the E.O.S. scope! Get down there as "
"quickly as possible and help defend it!\n"
"\n"
"If you need more assistance, request it from Midspace Support."
msgstr "Kraylor ships are directly attacking the E.O.S. scope! Get down there as quickly as possible and help defend it!\n\nIf you need more assistance, request it from Midspace Support."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1276
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"We've declared war on the Kraylor. Retaliate on their defenseless Endline "
"station!"
msgstr "We've declared war on the Kraylor. Retaliate on their defenseless Endline station!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1286
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid "Destroy the remaining Kraylor ships threatening our E.O.S. scope!"
msgstr "Destroy the remaining Kraylor ships threatening our E.O.S. scope!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1296
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"Dock at the E.O.S. scope to be refitted for wartime, and standby for orders."
msgstr "Dock at the E.O.S. scope to be refitted for wartime, and standby for orders."

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1307
#, lua-format
msgctxt "centralcommandOrders-comms"
msgid ""
"The Kraylor super-nebula hides a wormhole that we believe will be used in an "
"attack on human space. There is an entrance into the nebula in sector %s, "
"but be careful of traps!"
msgstr "The Kraylor super-nebula hides a wormhole that we believe will be used in an attack on human space. There is an entrance into the nebula in sector %s, but be careful of traps!"

#: scripts/scenario_11_edge_of_space.lua:1319
msgctxt "station-comms"
